TEXT 64 16 Left 3 ;CONFIGURABLE FLYBACK SSR -- native power circuit and controller
TEXT 64 64 Left 2 ;T1: LP / LS1...LSn. OUT is after blocking diode; CAP before it feeds the selector.
TEXT 64 96 Left 2 ;Values and enabled parts: design_params.inc. An optional diode with *_EN=0 is bypassed.
TEXT 848 144 Left 2 ;T1 primary
TEXT 112 896 Left 2 ;Controller settings: frequency / soft start / CS / SCP / OLP / hiccup
TEXT 1064 368 Left 2 ;T1 secondary OUT1
TEXT 1064 688 Left 2 ;T1 secondary OUT2
TEXT 1064 1008 Left 2 ;T1 secondary OUT3
TEXT 1064 1328 Left 2 ;T1 secondary OUT4
TEXT 1280 1720 Left 2 ;SSR ideal feedback senses CAP before blocking diode; FB_SELECT selects the rail.
TEXT 1280 1752 Left 2 ;Not an optocoupler/TL431 device model. Real feedback delay must be added for sign-off.
TEXT 64 1832 Left 2 !.include design_params.inc
TEXT 64 1864 Left 2 !.include coupling.inc
TEXT 64 1896 Left 2 !.include support.inc
TEXT 64 1928 Left 2 !.include analysis.inc
TEXT 64 2008 Left 2 ;support.inc contains the optional short-circuit test fixture. GND reference is mathematical, not a hardware bond.
